 (JANA Partners' 13D of 07/03/2014 at 9.9%; Longview's public sale advocacy of \"\n  \"07/07/2014) that pushed the board into a formal exploration announced 08/19/2014. Through an independent-director ad hoc committee and J.P. Morgan, \"\n  \"the target contacted 27 potential participants, signed confidentiality and standstill agreements with 15 financial buyers in early October, and received \"\n","status":"modified","additions":0,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited /tmp/opencode/petsmart/write_book.py (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\": \"sec('Commercial account')\\naccount = (\\\"PetSmart entered 2014 reviewing alternatives\", \"oldString\": \"sec('Commercial account')\\nsm.cell(row=r-1, column=1).value = None\\naccount = (\\\"PetSmart entered 2014 reviewing alternatives\", \"path\": \"/tmp/opencode/petsmart/write_book.py\"}"},"time":{"start":1789825106185,"end":1789825106494}}}}
