t pp. 21–26. Local source: ../raw_filing/petsmart_2015-02-02_DEFM14A.htm')\n blank()\n \n sec('Process and round map (Process 1 — single continuing sale attempt; ends in signing; no termination or restart observed)')\n","status":"modified","additions":2,"deletions":0}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited /tmp/opencode/petsmart/write_book.py (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\": \"line('Termination fees', 'Company termination fee $255 million; Parent reverse termination fee $510 million (supported by several Buyer Group termination-fee commitment letters up to the $510 million cap); expense reimbursement up to $15 million. [XCTF; XPTF; XTFC; XTFC2; XEXP]')\\nline('Regulatory (Summary line)', 'HSR notification filed by both parties 12/24/2014; early termination of the HSR waiting period received 01/07/2015; Canadian Advance Ruling Certificate issued 01/14/2015. Regulatory filings and clearances are not ledger rows. [XHSR]')\\nline('Litigation (Summary line)', 'Seven putative class actions filed in the Delaware Court of Chancery after the 12/14/2014 announcement challenging the merger (price/process and proxy-disclosure allegations); amended complaints filed 01/20/2015 and 01/30/2015. Litigation is not a ledger row. [XLIT]')\", \"oldString\": \"line('Termination fees', 'Company termination fee $255 million; Parent reverse termination fee $510 million (supported by several Buyer Group termination-fee commitment letters up to the $510 million cap); expense reimbursement up to $15 million. [XCTF; XPTF; XTFC; XTFC2; XEXP]')\", \"path\": \"/tmp/opencode/petsmart/write_book.py\"}"},"time":{"start":1789825226702,"end":1789825228599}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1789825228604,"sessionID":"ses_f46293c76ffe0Qb4SRXqQEDupS","part":{"partID":"prt_0b9e59bfc001pU97oH0835f07O","sessionID":"ses_f46293c76ffe0Qb4SRXqQEDupS","messageID":"msg_0b9e57431001jgHujw4XeL14yZ","type":"tool","id":"call_01_c4Fp5y9uQxzE4yBH7ukN6366","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"line('Post-signing', 'No post-signing competing proposals, go-shop or agreement termination observed. No go-shop was provided; the 15 signers\\' standstills limit post-signing bids (XSTAND). As of 02/02/2015 no unsolicited offer had been made (XNOOFF).')\nline('Process outcome', 'Process 1 ended in signing with the Buyer Group on 12/14/2014; no Process terminated/restarted row applies. The remaining live rival (Bidder 2) was closed with a stated Not selected at signing outcome; the winner has no exit row.')","oldString":"line('Post-signing', 'No post-signing competing proposals, go-shop or agreement termination observed. No go-shop was provided; the 15 signers\\' standstills limit post-signing bids (XSTAND). As of 02/02/2015 no unsolicited offer had been made (XNOOFF).')","path":"/tmp/opencode/petsmart/write_book.py"},"output":"Edited /tmp/opencode/petsmart/write_book.py (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"/tmp/opencode/petsmart/write_book.py","patch":"Index: /tmp/opencode/petsmart/write_book.py\n===================================================================\n--- /tmp/opencode/petsmart/write_book.py\n+++ /tmp/opencode/petsmart/write_book.py\n@@ -230,8 +230,9 @@\n line('Round 1 — solicitation / IOI stage', 'Opened R016, anchored on the confidentiality-agreement wave (first week of October 2014; Not final). Scope: 15 financial NDA signers (R017; all engaged in diligence and received the Profit Improvement Plan information). Deadline set in October: non-binding IOIs due 10/30/2014 (R018), treatment Enforced (R019). Six indicated (R020–R023); nine non-submitters inferred (R024). Two submitters eliminated on 11/03/2014 (R027). Round-bidder tally: 6 new bidder units.')\n line('Round 2 — finalist stage', 'Opened R026 on 11/03/2014 (Inferred final): four bidders at/above $80.00 advanced (Buyer Group, Bidder 2, and the two bidders later forming Bidder 3; see Q2). Two bidders authorized to combine → Bidder 3 (R028; final-round units 4 → 3). Further diligence during November. Round-bidder tally: 0 new bid units (no priced submission in this stage).')\n line('Round 3 — final-bid stage', 'Opened R029, anchored on the first request for final bids (merger-agreement circulation, November 2014; Announced as final). Deadline history: 12/05/2014 initial date set (R032; superseded before arrival, no milestone row) → revised 12/04–05 to evening 12/10/2014 (R033), treatment Extended (R034) → improved bids 12/12/2014 (R039), treatment Enforced (R040). Bids: 12/10 — Buyer Group $80.70 cash (R035), Bidder 2 $80.35 cash (R036), Bidder 3 verbal ≤ ~$78 (R037; did not submit, R038); 12/12 — Bidder 2 $81.50 best-and-final (R042), Buyer Group $82.50 interim (R043) then $83.00 best-and-final (R044). Approval 12/13/2014 (R045); Bidder 2 not selected at signing (R046). Round-bidder tally: 3 new bid units; 2 units submitted improved best-and-final bids.')\n line('Post-signing', 'No post-signing competing proposals, go-shop or agreement termination observed. No go-shop was provided; the 15 signers\\' standstills limit post-signing bids (XSTAND). As of 02/02/2015 no unsolicited offer had been made (XNOOFF).')\n+line('Process outcome', 'Process 1 ended in signing with the Buyer Group on 12/14/2014; no Process terminated/restarted row applies. The remaining live rival (Bidder 2) was closed with a stated Not selected at signing outcome; the winner has no exit row.')\n blank()\n \n sec('Participants and advisers')\n line('Buyer Group (winner)', 'Financial. Consortium of funds advised by BC Partners, Inc., La Caisse de dépôt et placement du Québec, affiliates of GIC Special Investments Pte Ltd and affiliates of StepStone Group LP; Longview Asset Management, LLC joins after 12/12/2014 (rollover, not a bidding-unit membership change). First observed 10/30/2014 (IOI $81–$83; R020); final bids $80.70 (R035), $82.50 interim (R043), $83.00 best and final (R044); signed 12/14/2014 (R047). Receives Longview support (R041). No exit row (winner).')\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":0}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited /tmp/opencode/petsmart/write_book.py (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\": \"line('Post-signing', 'No post-signing competing proposals, go-shop or agreement termination observed. No go-shop was provided; the 15 signers\\\\' standstills limit post-signing bids (XSTAND). As of 02/02/2015 no unsolicited offer had been made (XNOOFF).')\\nline('Process outcome', 'Process 1 ended in signing with the Buyer Group on 12/14/2014; no Process terminated/restarted row applies. The remaining live rival (Bidder 2) was closed with a stated Not selected at signing outcome; the winner has no exit row.')\", \"oldString\": \"line('Post-signing', 'No post-signing competing proposals, go-shop or agreement termination observed. No go-shop was provided; the 15 signers\\\\' standstills limit post-signing bids (XSTAND). As of 02/02/2015 no unsolicited offer had been made (XNOOFF).')\", \"path\": \"/tmp/opencode/petsmart/write_book.py\"}"},"time":{"start":1789825227772,"end":1789825228604}}}}
